1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==brief biography and family==
2 CONT Anastasia Areobinda (b. c. 570), apparently daughter of Areobindus (b. c. 550) and wife, paternal granddaughter of Anastasius (c. 530 - aft. 571) and wife Juliana (b. c. 533), great-granddaughter of Flavius Anastasius Paulus Probu
2 CONC s Sabinianus Pompeius (c. 500 - aft. 517), Roman Consul in 517, and wife Theodora (b. c. 515), who was the natural daughter of Empress Theodora.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anastasia was the wife of Petrus (Peter) Augustus the Curopalates (Master of the Palace) the brother of Holy Roman and Byzantine Emperor Maurice.
2 CONT
