2 CONT *[109] Iordanes Romanorum, MGH Auct. ant. V.1, p. 40. 
2 CONT *[110] Iordanes Romanorum, MGH Auct. ant. V.1, p. 42. 
2 CONT *[111] Marcellini v. c. comitis Chronicon 424, MGH Auct. ant. XI, p. 76. 
2 CONT *[112] Marcellini v. c. comitis Chronicon 425, MGH Auct. ant. XI, p. 76. 
2 CONT *[113] Chronicon Paschale, Vol. I, p. 580. 
2 CONT *[114] Iordanes Getarum, MGH Auct. ant. V.1, p. 118. 
