2 CONT
2 CONT [[16]] For sources for the names and dates see the documentation providedin PLRE II, 410 s.v. Aelia Eudoxia 1. The eldest, Flaccilla, died before408, since she is not mentioned among the children who survived theirfather (Soz., HE
2 CONC  9.1).
