2 CONT Life
2 CONT
2 CONT Pulcheria was born as the daughter of the Emperor Arcadius and his Frankish-born wife Aelia Eudoxia. She was named after a daughter of Theodosius I and Aelia Flaccilla, who was born in 378 and died in 385.
