1 NOTE Half brother of Galla, Served as the Eastern Roman emperor 393 through 395 Served as the the Western emperor 495 through 423. Under the control of the Vandal Flavius Stilicho whom he murdered.
2 CONT This act caused the Vandals who were in the Roman army to shift over to the Visigoth Chieftan, Alaric I who promptly invaded Roman Italy. At the age of nine became Augustus 23, Jan 393.
2 CONT Flavius Honorius died Aug 15, 423 of Dropsy
2 CONT Interesting note: Under his rein  gladitorial fights ended.
