2 CONC ora braniti Sisciliju, ali je tamo mučki i izdajnički ubijen."
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Translation''': Marcian was originally from Dalmatia and ruled it practically independently in the period 454-468. He was a friend of the military leader Aetius, who was killed in 454, and Marcian showed respect and obedience t
2 CONC o the emperor. In 468 he was summoned to defend Siscilia, but was brutally and treacherously killed there.
