2 CONT ID: I21148 Name: Flavius Theodosius of Rome Prefix: Count Given Name: Flavius Theodosius Surname: of Rome Nickname: The Elder Sex: M _UID: F2D7FF26AD49D811BE490080C8C142CCEB03 Change Date: 14 Aug 2004 Birth: 325 Birth: ABT 325 in 
2 CONC Caus Castle, Salop Death: of executed 375 in Carthage, Africa Death: 375
2 CONT
