2 CONT -------------------- Titres: Chef Franc de Toxandrie http://gw.geneanet.org/nobily?lang=fr;pz=elisabeth+therese+marie+helene;nz=de+belgique;ocz=0;p=richimir;n=de+toxandrie <nowiki>--------------------</nowiki> A Frank in the 4th c
2 CONC entury who became a Supreme Commander in the Eastern Empire. Fought against the Romans and the Goths. Founded Brandenburg.
