1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albia_Dominica
2 CONT
2 CONT Domnica Empress of the East	
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Petronius of Rome
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother	
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage	- Valens Emperor of the East
2 CONT
