2 CONT
2 CONT Died :	26 Jun 363	Killed in Persia, ruled 360-363
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Julius Constantinus Prince of the West	
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother	Basilina Princess of the West	
2 CONT
