2 CONC gt, Constantin der Grosse und sein Jahrhundert, 2nd ed. (Munich, 1960) 142; Guthrie, "The Execution of Crispus" 325; Jones-Martindale-Morris, PLRE I 233; Lippold in Der Kleine Pauly V (1975) 1592; "No later than 300," Barnes, New 
2 CONC Empire 44, is to be rejected as being too early. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Full discussion in Pohlsander, "Crispus" 81-82, and in König, Origo Constantini 137. 
2 CONT
