2 CONC ie constantinische Goldprägung (Mainz, 1963) 209, nos. 623-26. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [[12]]A good summary is provided by Raissa Calza, Iconografia Romana imperiale da Carausio a Giuliano (Rome, 1972) 273-74. 
