1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Fabia Orestilla From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia Fabia Orestilla was the great-granddaughter of Roman emperor Antoninus Pius and the wife of subsequent emperor Gordian I.[1] She married him probably in 192 and
2 CONC  had two sons and a daughter.[1] Orestilla is only mentioned in the Augustan History. Modern historians do not believe that Orestilla was the wife of emperor Gordian I and dismiss this name and her information as false, as they be
2 CONC lieve his wife was the granddaughter of Greek Sophist, consul and tutor Herodes Atticus.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fabia_Orestilla
