2 CONT Lucius Junius Caesennius Paetus (c. 45 - aft. 94) was a Roman politician.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son and namesake of Lucius Caesennius Paetus and wife Flavia.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was Consul Suffectus in 79 and later Proconsul of Asia in 93 or 94.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married and had a son, also Lucius Junius Caesennius Paetus, born c. 65, who married Arria Antonina, born c. 70, a maternal aunt of Antoninus Pius, and had a son Lucius Caesennius Antoninus.
