2 CONT She is a non existent person, not the daughter of Constantius III and Galla Placida - they had no such offspring.
2 CONT They were married in 417 after her return from Visigothic Spain and had only two children, Just Grata Honoria (417) and Valentinian III (419). Constantius died in 421.  -no children born in 370, as claimed by genealogies online an
2 CONC d Fab pedigree.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is not listed here as the daughter of anybody and that is correct...because she never existed in the first place!
