2 CONT  Plutarch's Sertorius: A Historical Commentary. C. Konrad Chapel Hill: University of North Carolina Press, 1994
2 CONT  Marcus Aurelius, by Anthony Richard Birley, Routledge, 2000
2 CONT  A dictionary of the Roman Empire By Matthew Bunson – 1995
