2 CONT # Rogers, Robert Samuel. "Heirs and Rivals to Nero." Transactions and Proceedings of the American Philogical Association, Vol. 86. 1955, pp. 190-212
2 CONT # Hazel, John. "Piso, 1." Who's Who in the Roman World. London: Routledge, 2001.
2 CONT # The Cambridge Ancient History. Vol. 5, VII ed. London: Cambridge University Press, 1970-2007.
