2 CONT
2 CONT Sherwin-White, A. N. The Roman Citizenship 2. Oxford, 1973.
2 CONT
2 CONT Smallwood, E. M. Documents Illustrating the Principates of Gaius, Claudius, and Nero . Cambridge, 1967.
2 CONT
