2 CONT JULIA GERUNDA verch TIBERIUS CLAUDIUS II DRUSUS NERO
2 CONT
2 CONT 	BIRTH: 10 A.D. in Lugundum, Gaul - now Lyons, Rhone-Alpes, France
2 CONT
