3 CONT his mother →  Antonia Marcianilla 
3 CONT her mother →  Antonius Marcellinus 
3 CONT her father →  Antonius Marcellinus 
3 CONT his father → Amantia Marina 
3 CONT his mother →  Caeionia Marina 
3 CONT her mother →  Marcus Caeionius Varo 
3 CONT her father →  Flavia Postumia Varia 
3 CONT his mother →  Titus Flavius Titianus, Consul c200 
