2 CONT [http://www.geni.com/people/Tigranes-VI-King-of-Armenia/6000000011707358659?through=6000000003645870120#/tab/discussion  Please See Discussion on this NOT being the mother of Julia of Chalcis, but likely an error by Wagner not kno
2 CONC wing this Berenike was also known as Julia Berenike, Queen of Chalcis herself. Opgalli vsJulia of Chalcis as Tigranes' wife]
