2 CONT '''(Claudia) Livia Julia''' (Classical Latin: LIVIA•IVLIA[1]), most commonly known by her family nickname '''Livilla''' (the "little Livia") (c. 13 BC – 31 A.D.), was the only daughter of '''Nero Claudius Drusus(38-9 BC)''' and ''
2 CONC 'Antonia Minor (36 BC-AD 37)'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Spouse	
