2 CONT '''Marcus Lollius Paulinus'''[1] '''Decimus Valerius Asiaticus Saturninus'''[2] (69/70 – after 134) was a prominent[3] Roman Senator who was a powerful figure in the second half of the 1st century and first half of the 2nd century
2 CONC .[2]
