1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''
2 CONT =Lucius Cornelius Sulla=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Lucius Cornelius Sulla was a Roman senator of the Augustan age. Perhaps he was a son of Publius Cornelius Sulla, designated consul for 65 BC, which made him a grandnephew of the Roman dictator Lucius Cornelius Sulla. Lucius Cornel
2 CONC ius Sulla was consul (together with the emperor Augustus) in 5 BC. His sons were Faustus Cornelius Sulla Lucullus and Lucius Cornelius Sulla Magnus, both of whom became senators in Emperor Tiberius's reign.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucius_Cornelius_Sulla_(consul_5_BC)
