2 CONT
2 CONT Moriarty, G. Andrews. "The Origin of the Carolingians", The New England Historical and Genealogical Register volume XCVIII (October 1944). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Stuart, Roderick W. Royalty for Commoners, The Complete Known Lineage of John of Gaunt, Son of Edward III, King of England, and Queen Philippa. Fourth Edition. Baltimore: Genealogical Publishing Company, 2002, p. 128. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Weis, Frederick Lewis. Ancestral Roots of Sixty Colonists Who Came to New England Between 1623 and 1650. Fifth Edition. Baltimore, Maryland: Genealogical Publishing Co., 1982. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Weis, Frederick Lewis. Ancestral Roots of Certain American Colonists, 7th Edition, additions by Walter Lee Shippard Jr., 1999
2 CONT
