2 CONT Elidyr ap Sandde, Brenin Ynys Manau1
2 CONT
2 CONT b. circa 720
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Sandde ab Alcun1 b. circa 690
2 CONT
2 CONT      Also called Elider English. Elidyr ap Sandde, Brenin Ynys Manau was the 4th great grandson of Llywarch Hen, and heir to the lost Kingdom of South Rheged.1 Also called Elidurus filius Xanthus Latin. He was born circa 720 at Po
2 CONC wys, Wales.1 He was the son of Sandde ab Alcun.1 Elidyr ap Sandde, Brenin Ynys Manau married Celemion verch Tudwal o Ynys Manau, daughter of Brenin Ynys Manau Tudwal III ab Anarawd o Ynys Manau, before 750.1 Elidyr ap Sandde, Bren
2 CONC in Ynys Manau transferred his family from Powys to Ynys Manaw (Isle of Man) when he married the heiress of its little Kingdom in the mid-8th century circa 750.1 Heir to South Rheged circa 750.1 He died at Isle of Man, Wales.
2 CONT
