2 CONT Merfyn Frych
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Merfyn was not a member of the traditional dynasty of Gwynedd, the direct male line of Maelgwn Gwynedd, and his succession marked the start of a new dynasty. His claim was apparently based on the fact that his mother, Esyllt, was 
2 CONC the daughter of Cynan Dindaethwy ap Rhodri and the niece of Hywel ap Rhodri. 
