2 CONT  Merfyn (The Freckled) Frych ap Gwriad   
2 CONT
2 CONT Merfyn, known as The Freckled, was born in 0764 in Wales.1   The Freckled's father was Gwriad ap Elidir and his mother was Esyllt verch Cynan.  His maternal grandparents were Cynan (Dindaethwy) ap Rhodri and <Unknown>. He had a br
2 CONC other named Cadrod.  He was the older of the two children.  He died as a war casualty at the age of 80 in 0844 in Battle of Cyfeil, Ketell, Wales.1 
2 CONT
