2 CONT Sextus Julius Caesar I
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived circa 200 BC. Son of Lucius Julius Caesar I and grandson of Numerius Julius Caesar. Sextus was a military tribune under Lucius Aemilius Paullus, as well as a governor of Liguria. His sons were Gaius Julius Caesar I and Sextu
2 CONC s Julius Caesar II.
