2 CONT Rhodri (Mawr, The Great) ap Merfyn   
2 CONT
2 CONT Rhodri, known as Mawr, The Great, was born about 0820 in Caer Seiont, Carnarvonshire, Wales.1   Mawr, The Great's father was Merfyn (The Freckled) Frych ap Gwriad and his mother was Nest verch Cadell.  His paternal grandparents we
2 CONC re Gwriad ap Elidir and Esyllt verch Cynan; his maternal grandparents were Cadell ap Brochwel and <Unknown>.  He was an only child.  He died about 0878 in Anglessey, Wales.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Rhodri (Mawr, The Great) ap Merfyn & Angharad verch Meurig 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had nine sons and two daughters, named Anarawd, Merfyn, Cadell, Aeddan, Tudwal, Meurig, Rhodri, Gwriad, Gwyddelig, Nest and Angharad.
