2 CONT ------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT After her brother Gwrgon died without an heir, the rulership of Seisyllwg was claimed by Rhodri Mawr, but though he was unable to legitimately hold it, he was able to give it to Cadell, their son.
2 CONT
