2 CONT Angharad verch Meurig   
2 CONT
2 CONT Angharad was born about 0825 in Ceredigion, Wales.1   Angharad's father was Meurig ap Dyfnwallon and her mother was <Unknown>.  Her paternal grandparents were Dyfnwallon ap Arthen and <Unknown>. She had a brother named Gwygan.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rhodri (Mawr, The Great) ap Merfyn & Angharad verch Meurig 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had nine sons and two daughters, named Anarawd, Merfyn, Cadell, Aeddan, Tudwal, Meurig, Rhodri, Gwriad, Gwyddelig, Nest and Angharad.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Personal Details'''
2 CONT Rhodri (Mawr, The Great) ap Merfyn Rhodri, known as Mawr, The Great, was born about 0820 in Caer Seiont, Carnarvonshire, Wales.1   He died about 0878 in Anglessey, Wales.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Angharad verch Meurig Angharad was born about 0825 in Ceredigion, Wales.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT >'''Children'''
2 CONT >King of Gwynedd Anarawd ap Rhodri Anarawd was born about 0857 in Gwynedd, Wales.2   He died in 0916.3 
2 CONT >Merfyn ap Rhodri Merfyn was born about 0859.2   He died in 0901.4 
2 CONT >Cadell ap Rhodri Cadell was born about 0861 in Deheubarth, Wales.1   He died in 0909.1 
