1 NOTE OR "HYWEL"; PRINCE OF SOUTH WALES; KING OF ALL WALES 907-948; SURNAMED "THE
2 CONT GOOD""DDA/DHA"; CELEBRATED AS THE JUSTINIAN OF CUMBRIO; INSTITUTED A TRIAL BY
2 CONT JURY OF TWLEVE GOOD MEN AND A JUSGE (AS WITH CHRIST AND THE 12 APOSTLES)
1 NOTE Created the Kingdom of Deheubarth
