2 CONT
2 CONT Llewelyn was excluded from his crown by his uncle Cadell, and his cousin, Hywel Dha, who later married his daughter, Angharad.
2 CONT
2 CONT From: http://www.robertsewell.ca/powys.html
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Excluded from his throne by the usurpation of his uncle Cadell, and his cousin Howel Dha, successively Kings of South Wales.
