2 CONT Source: History of Morgan Family.   Descended from Votiporix, the third centruy Irish invader of South Wales.   Simpson calls her Elna and ancestry up to Constantius II comes from Simpson.
2 CONT Elen was the daughter and heiress of the Prince of Dyfed, Llwarch ap Hyfaidd. She was descended from Votiporix, the third century Irish invader of South Wales.
2 CONT
