2 CONT
2 CONT    Events:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Alt. Birth: Llandilo, Carmarthan, Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT    Marriage Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT Angharad married Owain AP HYWEL King of Deheubarth, son of Hywel "Ddu" (The Good) ÀP CADELL King of Dyfed, Seisyllwg, Gwyned and Elen FERCH LLYWARCH 4841. (Owain AP HYWEL King of Deheubarth was born in 913 in Dynevor Castle, Lland
2 CONC yfeisant, Carmarthenshire, Wales and died in 989
