2 CONT                            ******* SOURCES:  1.  Morgan, Dennis.  _A History of the Morgan Family_.  Also called Einion      and Eineon.  "Married Ellinor, daughter of Gwenston.  Killed in battle      with the Chief of Gwent.  Son
