2 CONC les, and were joined by Hywel & Maredudd, sons of Edwin ab Einion. Llwelyn obtained a decisive victory, but fell by the hand of an assassin. Source: Lloyd, History of the Princes etc.(vol 1-page 68)
2 CONT
