1 NOTE Cadell was the eldest son of Einion and was the legal and rightful prince 
2 CONT of South Wales, but on account of his youth, his grandfather Owain 
2 CONT requested that Cadell's uncle Moreudd take the throne.  It was the 
2 CONT grandfather's will but not Welsh law and a long civil war in South Wales 
2 CONT followed in which the house of Einion was bested for two or three 
2 CONT generations, then won out.
