1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Please see Darrell Wolcott: The Era of Llewelyn ap Seisyll; http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id207.html. Particularly Appendix I - Kings of Deheubarth. (Steven Ferry, June 1. 2017.)
