2 CONT
2 CONT Bartrum follows Dwnn i, 143 & 144, in erroneously placing this man under Owain ap Hywel Dda, when he should be listed as a son of Owain ap Morgan Hen, of Gwent: Please see Darrell Wolcott: Maredudd ap Owain, King of Deheubarth; ht
2 CONC tp://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id206.html. (Steven Ferry, July 17, 2020.)
