2 CONT 2. GRUFFYDD (-1128). Lord of Mawddy. The Annales Cambriæ record the death in 1128 of "Grifinus filius Meredut"[148]. m GWERFYL, daughter and heiress of GWRGENO ap Hywel Lord of Caer or Clydewen & his wife ---. Gruffydd & his wife 
2 CONC had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a) OWAIN "Cyfelliog" ([1125]-1195). Prince of Southern Powys 1160. He abdicated. 
2 CONT
2 CONT - see below, Part D. PRINCES of SOUTHERN POWYS. 
2 CONT
2 CONT b) MEURIG . 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. HYWEL (-1142). The Annales Cambriæ record that "Hoelus filius Maredut filii Bledint" was killed by his own men in 1142[149]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Maredudd & his second wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. IORWERTH Goch/the Red . m MAUD, daughter of ROGER de Manley & his wife ---. Iorwerth & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a) MADOG . 
