2 CONT TITLES Accession to Powys c 1116 Source: Fryde, Handbook of British Chronology -p54 Prince of Powys 1105-1130 Source: Lloyd, History of the Princes, the Lords Marcher and the Ancient Nobility of Powys Fadog, Vol 1, page 109.
