2 CONT       mother of Idnerth.  2.  Bartrum, Peter C., _Welsh Genealogies 300-1400 A.D.,_, "Iestyn 1", page      542, and "Elystan Glodrudd 1", page 354. Cadwgon ap Elystan Glodrydd was      married thre times, but the order of his wive
2 CONC s and which of Cadwgon's      children they were the mothers of is not clear from Bartrum's chart. His      wives ere Angharad verch Llawr (page 42), Jane verch Brochwel (page 48),      Efa Verch Gwrgan ("Iestyn 1").     Cadwgan a
