2 CONT 4.    Edith (or Aldgyth), seen at "Doomsday" 1086, death date unknown, m (1) ca. 1057 Griffith ap Llwellyn (176-2) slain 5 Aug. 1062; m. (2) prob. 1064 Harold (1B-23) Earl of Wessex,as Harlod II, King of England.  By Griffith she 
2 CONC had a dau. Nesta (see 176-3 and 177-2).  By Harold she had a son Harold, seen at domesday 1086, later life unknown, and possibly King Harold's son Ulf.  (NGSQ, Vol. 50, pp. 74-78 and cited references).
2 CONT
