2 CONT
2 CONT Darrell Wolcott states that Rhiwallon ap Cynfyn had no sons. The date of death is the same year as the Battle of Mynydd Carn, and this man may actually be Meilir ap Rhiwallon ap Gwyn ap Collwyn. Please see Darrell Wolcott: The Bat
