2 CONT ------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT MAREDUDD ap Bleddyn, son of BLEDDYN ap Cynfyn King of Gwynedd and Powys & his third wife Haer of Gest (-1132).  He succeeded his father in 1075 as MAREDUDD Prince of Powys.  The Annales Cambriæ record the death in 1132 of "Maredut
2 CONC  filius Bledint dux Powisorum"[145]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m firstly HUNYDD, daughter of EUNYDD [Efnydd] ap Gwernwy & his wife ---. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m secondly EVA, daughter of BLETRWS ap Ednowain Bendew & his wife ---. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Maredudd & his first wife had three children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.             MADOG ap Maredudd (-1161).  He succeeded his father in 1132 as Prince of Powys.  The Annales Cambriæ record the death in 1161 of "Madoc filius Maredut Powysorum princeps"[146].  m SUSANN of Gwynedd, daughter of GRUF
2 CONC FYDD ap Cynan King of Gwynedd & his wife Angharad of Deheubarth.  Madog & his wife had four children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)             LLYWELYN (-killed 1161).  The Annales Cambriæ record that "Lewelinus filius eius [Madoc filius Maredut Powysorum princeps]" was killed in 1161[147]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT b)             GRUFFYDD "Maelor" I (-1191).  Prince of Northern Powys (Fadog). 
2 CONT
2 CONT -        see below, Part C. PRINCES of NORTHERN POWYS. 
2 CONT
2 CONT c)             MARARED .  m IORWERTH Drwyndwyn ("Flat nose") Prince of Gwynedd, son of OWAIN ap Gruffyd King of Gwynedd & his first wife Gwladus --- (-1174). 
