2 CONT 2.             GRUFFYDD (-1128).  Lord of Mawddy.  The Annales Cambriæ record the death in 1128 of "Grifinus filius Meredut"[148].  m GWERFYL, daughter and heiress of GWRGENO ap Hywel Lord of Caer or Clydewen & his wife ---.  Gruf
2 CONC fydd & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)             OWAIN "Cyfelliog" ([1125]-1195).  Prince of Southern Powys 1160.  He abdicated. 
2 CONT
2 CONT -        see below, Part D. PRINCES of SOUTHERN POWYS. 
2 CONT
2 CONT b)             MEURIG . 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.             HYWEL (-1142).  The Annales Cambriæ record that "Hoelus filius Maredut filii Bledint" was killed by his own men in 1142[149]. 
