2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Tewdwr Mawr "The Great Prince" Of South Wales 1 2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sex: M 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: ABT 1000 in Dynevor, Llandyfeisant, Carmarthenshire, Wales 2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: Deceased 1 2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Reference Number: 7196
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Cadell Ap Einion b: ABT 964 in Deheubarth, Wales 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Elinor Verch Gwerystan b: ABT 980 in Powys, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Spouse Unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT  Rhys Ap (Tudor) Tewdor King Of South Wales b: ABT 1035 in Deheubarth, Wales
2 CONT
