2 CONC worth Field. (The dynasty also included King Henry VII and Queen Elizabeth I). One of Twdwr-Mawr's sons was Rhys." Died 994.   K: Tudor ap Cadwell. Slain at Pen Rhys in 1089. Lotsa difference re death.                          ***
2 CONC ***** His name is variously given as Twdwr, Tewdwr-Mawr, Tudor, Tewdor, Theodore.
