2 CONT
2 CONT Alternate possible familial connection:
2 CONT
2 CONT The Einion who supposedly married Nest ferch Iestyn:
2 CONT  If we identify him as a son of Cadifor Fawr ap Collwyn, it would give us an additional linkage between the Dyfed and Glamorgan families and would not require a 16th century tale to explain how the family of a Gwynedd man (Einion 
2 CONC ap Collwyn ap Tangno) ended up in Glamorgan. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id121.html
2 CONT
