2 CONT
2 CONT ____________________________________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Cydifor ApCydrych was born on May 1 1050, in Gwynfe, Llangadog Fawr, Carms, Wales, to King Cydrych Ap Gwaithfoed and Queen Nest Verch Ap Gwaithfoed (born Tangno).
2 CONT
2 CONT King was born on January 9 1020, in Gwynfe, Llangadog Fawr, Carmarthenshire, Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT Queen was born in 1027, in Powy, Merionethshire, Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cydifor had 2 brothers: Gruffydd Ap Cydrig and King Gruffudd ap Cydrych.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cydifor married Myfanwy Verch Gwrgan in 1069, at age 18 in Llangadog Fawr, Carmarthenshire, Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT Myfanwy was born in 1045, in Morgannwg Gwlad, Glamorgan, Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had one son: Meurig Fychan Ap Cydifor.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cydifor passed away on October 6 1106, at age 56 in Llangadog Fawr, Carmarthenshire, Wales
