2 CONT # WikiTree contributors, "Nesta (Osbern) de Neufmarché (bef.1075-1121)," WikiTree: The Free Family Tree, (https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Osbern-16 : accessed 20 November 2025). cites
2 CONT # http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHNOBILITYMEDIEVAL3D-K.htm#NestAgnesMBernardNeufmarche
2 CONT # https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osbern_fitzRichard “Osbern and his wife had a son, Hugh fitzOsbern,[2] and a daughter, Nesta (or perhaps Agnes), who married Bernard de Neufmarché.[4] Osbern perhaps had another son, Turstin, who is
2 CONC  named as the brother of Hugh fitzOsbern in a charter of Osbern fitzPons.[4]”
2 CONT # https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bernard_de_Neufmarche “Probably as a consequence of his rapid rise in the marches, Bernard attracted the attention of Osbern fitzRichard, who gave him his daughter, Agnes (Nest), whose mother was th
2 CONC e Welsh princess Nest, daughter of Gruffydd ap Llywelyn and Edith of Mercia, in marriage sometime before 1099.[8] She brought with her a dowry of Berrington and Little Hereford.”
