1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See Peter Bartrum, https://cadair.aber.ac.uk/dspace/bitstream/handle/2160/5210/Bleddyn%20ap%20Cynfyn%2046.png?sequence=1&isAllowed=y (June 19, 2017; Anne Brannen, curator)
