2 CONT Seisyll ap Llywelyn, arglwydd of Buellt
2 CONT
2 CONT >Cadwgan ab Elystan Glodrydd’s third son, Llywelyn, had a son called '''Sitsyllt''' who became Lord of Buellt and is the ancestor of the Cadogan family - Earls of Cadogan, amongst others.
2 CONT
