3 CONT
3 CONT This is one of the variation of coats of arms attributed or granted, and used by many of the families who were descended from Cadogan ab Elystan Glodrydd, and was incorporated as the most significant and majority part of the coat 
3 CONC of arms of Radnorshire. It is the design that is used most to be representative of the dynasty and ‘5th Royal Tribe’ as a whole.
