2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Cynfyn ap Gwerystan
2 CONT
2 CONT Cynfyn ap Gwerystan, b abt 995. He md Angharad verch Maredudd abt 1024, Wales, daughter of Maredudd ap Owain. He also fathered a child by either another wife or a mistress.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Cynfyn ap Gwerstan and Angharad verch Maredudd were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Rhiwallon ap Cynfyn b abt 1025. See LINE A
2 CONT
2 CONT Bleddyn ap Cynfyn b abt 1027. See LINE B
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Cynfyn ap Gwerystan and unknown wife or mistress was:
2 CONT
2 CONT Iwerydd verch Cynfyn b abt 1030. She md Edwin of Tegeingl abt 1046.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Iwerydd verch Cynfyn and Edwin of Tegeingl was:
2 CONT
2 CONT Owain ap Edwin b abt 1055. The identity of his wife is not known.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Owain ap Edwin was:
2 CONT
2 CONT Angharad verch Owain b abt 1065. She md Gruffydd ap Cynan, King of Gwynedd, abt 1098.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gruffydd ap Cynan, King of Gwynedd, b abt 1070, d 1137. He md Angharad verch Owain abt 1098, daughter of Owain ap Edwin. She was b abt 1084, d 1162.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Gruffydd ap Cynan and Angharad verch Owain were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Gwenllian verch Gruffydd b abt 1100, Wales. She md Gruffydd ap Rhys, Prince of South Wales, abt 1112, son of Rhys ap Tewdr-Mawr, Prince of South Wales, and Gwladus verch Rhiwallon.
2 CONT
2 CONT Owain-Gwynedd ap Gruffydd, Prince of North Wales, b abt 1104.
2 CONT
2 CONT Susanna verch Gruffydd b abt 1112, Aberffraw Castle, Anglesey, Wales. She md Madog ap Maredudd abt 1130, prob Wales, son of Maredudd ap Bleddyn, Prince of Powys, and Hunydd verch Einudd.
2 CONT
2 CONT By about 1118 Gruffydd's advancing years meant that most of the fighting which pushed Gwynedd's borders eastward and southwards was done by his three sons by his wife Angharad, daughter of Owain ab Edwin: Cadwallon, Owain Gwynedd 
2 CONC and later Cadwaladr.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT # ID: I4354
2 CONT
2 CONT # Name: Angharat verch Owain
2 CONT
2 CONT # Given Name: Angharat verch
