2 CONC nllian (wife of Gruffydd ap Rhys), Marared, Rannillt (named for her paternal grandmother), Susanna (who married Madog ap Maredudd), and Annest.
2 CONT P. 488: Owain Gwynedd fell into a deep melancholy when his mother died in 1162.
