2 CONT Owain (Owain Gwynedd) ap Gruffydd
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 1078 in Nant Gwynant, Caernarfon, Gwynedd, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Gruffudd ap Cynan and Angharad (Deuheubarth) ferch Owain
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Rhanullt (Gruffydd) ferch Gruffydd, Ellen (Gruffydd) ferch Gruffydd, Gwenllian (Gwynedd) of Wales, Susanna ferch Gruffudd, Merinedd (Gruffydd) ferch Gruffydd, Cadwaladr (Gruffydd) ap Gruffydd, Membyr (Gruffydd) ap Gruff
2 CONC ydd, Rhael (Gruffydd) ferch Gruffydd, Annes (Gruffydd) ferch Gruffydd, Margred (Gruffydd) ferch Gruffydd and Tudwal (Gruffydd) ap Gruffydd	 Husband of Gwladys (Llywarch) ferch Llywarch — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Cristin (Goronwy) ferch Goronwy — married 1145 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Cadell (Owain) ab Owain Gwynedd, Cynwrig (Owain) ab Owain Gwynedd, Ffilip ab (Owain) Owain Gwynedd, Hywel ab (Owain) Owain Gwynedd, Iago ab (Owain) Owain Gwynedd, Idwal ab (Owain) Owain Gwynedd, Madoc ab (Owain) Owain Gw
2 CONC ynedd, Maelgwyn ab (Owain) Owain Gwynedd, Rhidrid ab (Owain) Owain Gwynedd, Rhun (Owain) ab Owain Gwynedd, Rotpert ab (Owain) Owain Gwynedd, Iefan (Owain) ab Owain Gwynedd, Gwenllian ferch Owain, Angharad (Owain) ferch Owain ap Gw
2 CONC ynedd, Rhodri (Owain) Owain Gwynedd, Dafydd ab Owain Gwynedd, Margaret ferch (Owain) Owain Gwynedd, Einion (Owain) ab Owain Gwynedd, Iorweth ap Owain (Gwynedd) of Gwynedd, Angharad Owain (Gwynedd) ferch Owain and Cynan ab (Owain) 
