2 CONT
2 CONT * Nelson, Lynn H. The Normans in South Wales, 1070–1171. University of Texas Press: Austin, 1966.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Remfry, P. M. Hay on Wye Castle, 1066 to 1521. ISBN 1-899376-07-0.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Remfry, P. M. Castell Bwlch y Dinas and the Families of Fitz Osbern, Neufmarché, Gloucester, Hereford, Braose, Fitz Herbert. ISBN 1-899376-79-8.
