2 CONT     Transactions of the Royal Historical Society, 5th Ser., Vol. 35. (1985), pp 1–28.
2 CONT      Hunt, William (1885). "Bernard (fl.1093)". In Stephen, Leslie. Dictionary of National Biography 4. London: Smith, Elder & Co.
