2 CONC d lieutenant of the parts adjacent, by Henry I. He married Nesta, daughter of RHYS ap Tewdwr, Prince of South Wales, by whom he acquired the barony, manor, and castle of Carru, sith seven other lordships. Gerald, or Gerard Fitz-Wa
2 CONC lter the eldest son, having married Nesta, daughter of Rees, son of Theadore (Tudor), the Great Prince of South Wales had issue of three sons.  ________________________
