2 CONC h in South-West Wales. In 1100 he travelled to Ireland to seek the marriage of King Murrough's daughter to his over-lord, Arnulf de Montgomery. He held the office of Keeper of Pembroke Castle in 1102, after the disgrace of Arnulf.
