2 CONT Constable of Pembroke Castle, GERALD OF PEMBROKE KING HENRY 1 GAVE MOULESFORD IN BERKSHIRE1049 ALT B 1075 ALTB PEMBROKESHIRE WALES ALT D 1135, Constable of Pembroke, Constable of Pembroke Castle; Churchhill's 20th ggfather; Louis 
2 CONC XVII's 21st ggfather
2 CONT
2 CONT Please see Darrell Wolcott: Osbrwn Wyddel of Cors Gedol; http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id203.html. (Steven Ferry, August 30, 2020.)
