2 CONT Son of Gerald de Windsor (Constable of Pembroke Castle) and Nest , Princess of Wales Husband of Angh ferch Gruffudd; ? Garrard; Alice FitzGerald and Maria Marrio Fitz Gerald de Carew Father of William FitzWilliam FitzGerald; Willi
2 CONC am Garrard (Garrett); Raymond Fitzwalter FitzGerald, Constable of Leinster; Odo FitzWilliam de Carew; Isabel De Hastings (De Windsor); Griffyth FitzWilliam de Carew; Ida Fitzgerald; Robert Fitzgerald; Silvester Gerard; Ralph Fitzw
2 CONC illiam; Henry Gerard; Richard Fitzwilliam and Mabilia FitzWilliam « less Brother of David FitzGerald, Bishop of St. David's; Maurice FitzGerald, Lord of Lanstephan; Angharad FitzGerald; NN de Windsor; Hadewise de Hastings and 1 ot
2 CONC her Half brother of Lord Maurice FitzGerald; Henry FitzRoy; Lllewellyn Ab Owain, Prince of Powys and Robert FitzStephen
