2 CONT The son of William fitz Ranulph, we believe, was also named Payne and born c. 1080.  He married a "de Metz" lady who was probably a daughter of Warin the Bald de Metz and sister of the first Fulk fitzWarin.  By this lady, Payne ha
2 CONC d sons Hamo and William and a daughter, Miletta. 
2 CONT
