2 CONT Madog III ap Maredudd, Tywysog Powys b. c 1091 Susanna ferch Gruffudd ap Cynan c 1095 Maredudd I. a. B., Tywysog Powys b. 1047 Hunydd f. E. of Dyffrin Clwyd b. c 1066 Gryffydd a. C., King of Gwynedd b. c 1055\nd. 1137 |Angharad f.
2 CONC  O. of Tegeingl b. c 1072
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Madog III ap Maredudd, Tywysog Powys3,1 b. circa 1091, d. 1160
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother	Susanna ferch Gruffudd ap Cynan o Gwynedd1 b. circa 1095
2 CONT
2 CONT      Margred ferch Madog o Powys was born circa 1129 at Montgomeryshire, Wales. She was the daughter of Madog III ap Maredudd, Tywysog Powys and Susanna ferch Gruffudd ap Cynan o Gwynedd.3,1 Margred ferch Madog o Powys married Ior
2 CONC werth Drwyndwn ab Owain o Gwynedd, son of Owain Gwynedd ap Gruffydd, King of Gwynedd and Gwladus ferch Llywarch o Arwystli, in 1163; 1st cousins.3
2 CONT
