2 CONT Owain Brogyntyn, according to Welsh Biography Online, [accessed 3/11/2013] , author Professor Thomas Jones Pierce M.A. F.S.A. (1905-1964), Aberystwyth - Owain Brogyntyn (fl.1160-1188) was a Prince of Powys.  The natural son of Mad
2 CONC og ap Maredudd, the last king of Powys. He left three sons, Bleddyn, Iorwerth and Gruffydd by Margaret, daughter of Einion ap Seisyll of Mathafarn. 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Courtesy of fantastically full family tree cf.:
2 CONT
2 CONT Hughes of Gwerclas 1/2/3/4:
2 CONT
