2 CONT *Prince Owain & his second wife had two children:
2 CONT **3.         '''DAFYDD (-1203).''' ... 
2 CONT **m ([1174]) EMMA d'Anjou, illegitimate daughter of GEOFFROY V "le Bel/Plantagenet" Comte d'Anjou & his mistress ---. Dafydd & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT ***a)         OWAIN . 
