2 CONT The documentation and source material for the Malpas lines are fraught and contradictory.  Darrell Wollcott gives several charts that untangles them, according to place and time -- see http://www.ancientwalesstudies.org/id152.html
2 CONC  (December 29, 2015; Anne Brannen, curator)
2 CONT
