1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of WALTER [I] FitzRichard, son of RICHARD FitzPons & his wife Matilda --- (-1190), NOT Sir Walter Clifford III and Margred  verch Llewelyn. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Hugh FitzHugh de Say, son of HUGH FitzOsbern & his wife Eustachia de Say (-1190). (He adopted his mother's family name.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Three children:
2 CONT
2 CONT HUGH de Say [II] ([1165/70]-killed in battle ([1196]).
2 CONT
2 CONT RICHARD de Say of Rochford (-after 1200). 
2 CONT
2 CONT GILBERT de Say (-after 1210).
2 CONT
2 CONT Survived her husband and took for her second husband Bartholomew de Mortimer.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHNOBILITYMEDIEVAL3P-S.htm#HughFitzHughSayB
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHNOBILITYMEDIEVAL3P-S.htm#_Toc21501818
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT * https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Say-7
2 CONT * ''Proceedings of the Somersetshire Archaeological and Natural History Society''.  By Somersetshire Archaeological and Natural History Society.  Page 207.  < [https://books.google.com/books?id=_YwaAQAAIAAJ&lpg=RA1-PA209&ots=PNFtA
2 CONC ZyW7u&dq=Lucy%20de%20Say%2C%20was%20the%20father%20of%20Ralph%20d%27Arderne&pg=RA1-PA207#v=onepage&q&f=false GoogleBooks] > 
