2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Has Children Gruffudd ap Gwenwynwyn b: Abt 1200-1215 in Powys, Montgomeryshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. Has Children Constance Keveliock b: 1218
2 CONT --------------------
