2 CONT Born in Aberffraw, Wales on 1164 to Iorwerth Ap Owain and Margred Verch Madog. Llewelyn married Tangwystl Verch Llywarch and had 2 children. Llewelyn married Joan and had 5 children. He passed away on 1240 in Aberconwy, Wales.
