2 CONT     Llywelyn died 11 April 1240[7] at the Cisterician Abbey of Aberconwy, Arllechwedd Isaf, Caernarvonshire, Wales, where he had "taken on the habit of religion."[23] He is buried at Aberconwy Abbey.[7] 
