1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Many sources give the wife of Einion ap Rhys Goch ap Llewelyn Fychan as Sian verch Einion ap Seisyll, but were that so, she would be much too young for the marriage.  It is Darrell Wolcott who suggests that she is 
