2 CONT Based on charting provided by Darrell Wolcott, Center for the Study of Ancient Wales. Peter Bartrum, in his Aleth charts, conflates two cousin lines, one descending from c. 1050 Aleth ap Uchdrydd, the other form his brother, c. 10
2 CONC 55 Gwrgeneu ap Uchdryd, with both sides having a long chain of same named men. ( Steven Ferry, April 16, 2023.)
