2 NOTE Yes by marriage, we can trace our Dalton line back to King Henry II of England. We are even related to Emperor Charlemagne. See below.
3 CONT
3 CONT 1. CHARLEMAGNE was born on Apr. 2 742 in Aachen, Rhineland, Prussia. He died on Jan. 28 814 in Aachen, Rhineland, Prussia. He married HILDIGARD, Empress of the West. She was born about 757 at Aachen. 
3 CONT
3 CONT 2 .LOUIS I, Emperor of the Holy Roman Empire and the West. He was born Aug. 778 in Casseneuil, France. He died in 840. He married JUDITH OF BAVARIA. She was born 800 in Bavaria and died on Oct. 6 877 in Tours, France.
3 CONT
3 CONT 3. CHARLES II, King of France, was born May 15 823 in Frankfurt, Prussia and died Oct 6 877 in Brios, France. He married Hermentrude, Queen of France, born about 825 in Orleans, France. She died Oct 6 869. 
3 CONT
3 CONT 4. JUDITH. was born in 846 in France. She married BALDWIN I, Count of Franders. 
3 CONT Baldwin l was born about 840 in Flanders, France. He died in 879. 
3 CONT
3 CONT 5. BALDWIN II, Count of Flanders, born 865 and died 918. He married ELFRIDA, 
3 CONT Princess of England, daughter of ALFRED and EALHSWITH. 
3 CONT
3 CONT 6. ARNULF l, born 890 of Flanders, France, March 27 965. 
3 CONT He married Alix de Vermandois of France.
3 CONT
3 CONT 7. BALDWIN III, of Flanders, France, born about 935 and died 962. 
3 CONT He married Matilida 
3 CONT
3 CONT Child of BALDWIN III and Matilida is: 
3 CONT i. ARNULF II
3 CONT
3 CONT 8. ARNULF II, Count of Flanders, was born Dec. 961 and died 987. 
3 CONT He married Susanne of Italy. 
3 CONT
3 CONT 9. BALDWIN IV, Count of Flanders, born in 980, He died May 30 1035. 
3 CONT He married Oqive de Luxembourg. 
3 CONT
3 CONT 10.BALDWIN V, Count of Flanders, died 1067. 
3 CONT He married Adela, Princess of France. 
3 CONT
3 CONT 11. MATILDA, QUEEN OF ENGLAND. She married WILLIAM I. “The Conqueror” 
3 CONT Born Oct 14 1024 in Falais, France. He died on Sept 9 1087 in Hermenbraville, France. 
3 CONT
3 CONT 12. HENRY I was born 1068 in Selby, Yorkshire, England and died Dec 1 1135, 
3 CONT Gisons, France. He married MATILDA born 1086. (Also known as Edith “Atheling”) 
3 CONT
3 CONT 13. MATILDA was born Bef. August 05, 1102 in London, Middlesex, England, and died September 10, 1169 in Notre Dame, Rouen, Seine-Maritime, France1. She married GEOFFREY PLANTAGENET V1 May 22, 1127 in Le Mans, Sarthe, France, son o
3 CONC f FOULQUES D'ANJOU and ERMENGARDE DU MAINE. 
3 CONT
3 CONT 14. HENRY II, PLANTAGENET was born March 05, 1132/33 in Le Mans, Sarthe, France, and died July 06, 1189 in Chinon, Indre-Et-Loire, France. 
