1 NOTE Henry II (of England) (1133-89), king of England (1154-89), first
1 NOTE monarch of the house of Anjou, or Plantagenet, an important
1 NOTE king to choose him as his successor; on Stephen's death, the
1 NOTE called Richard the Lion-Hearted.
