1 CONT Maas, Michael (ed.). The Cambridge Companion to the Age of Justinian, Cambridge 2005. 
1 CONT Rubin, Berthold (1960). Das Zeitalter Iustinians. Berlin. — German standard work; partially obsolescent, but still useful. 
