0 @N6000000002187712422@ NOTE Claudius
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Emperor of the Roman Empire 
1 CONT
1 CONT Reign January 24 41–October 13, 54 
1 CONT Full name Tiberius Claudius Caesar
1 CONT Augustus Germanicus (Britannicus AD 44) 
1 CONT Born August 1 10 BC 
1 CONT  Lugdunum 
1 CONT Died October 13, 54 (age 64) 
