1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] Claudius' affliction and personality
1 CONT
1 CONT Detail of statue of Claudius as Jupiter.Roman imperial dynasties
1 CONT Julio-Claudian dynasty Augustus 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT    Natural - Julia the Elder 
1 CONT    Adoptive - Gaius Caesar, Lucius Caesar, Agrippa Postumus, Tiberius 
1 CONT Tiberius 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT    Natural - Julius Caesar Drusus 
1 CONT    Adoptive - Germanicus 
1 CONT Caligula 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT    Natural - Julia Drusilla 
1 CONT    Adoptive - Tiberius Gemellus 
1 CONT Claudius 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT    Natural - Claudia Antonia, Claudia Octavia, Britannicus 
