1 CONT Suetonius, Lives of the Twelve Caesars: Claudius 17, 26, 27, 29, 36, 37, 39; Nero 6; Vitellius 2 
1 CONT Tacitus, Annals, XI. 1, 2, 12, 26-38 
1 CONT Sextus Aurelius Victor, epitome of Book of Caesars, 4 
1 CONT
