1 CONT Publius Mucius Scaevola and Marcus Aemilius Lepidus Consul of the Roman Republic
1 CONT with Spurius Postumius Albinus Paullulus
1 CONT 174 BC Succeeded by
1 CONT Lucius Postumius Albinus and Marcus Popillius Laenas 
