1 CONT     Sextus Julius Caesar I was a military tribune under Lucius Aemilius Paulus. He was proconsul in Liguria. In his time, 200 B.C. books instead of being written on one long sheet of scroll and rolled, were of many leaves bound to
1 CONC gether.
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Father: Lucius Julias CAESAR b: BEF 100
1 CONT
1 CONT Marriage 1 Spouse Unknown
1 CONT
1 CONT Children
1 CONT
1 CONT    1. Has Children Sextus Julius Caesar II ROME
1 CONT    2. Has Children Caius Julius I CAESAR
1 CONT
1 CONT
