1 CONT Merfyn ap Rhodri was a late 9th century King of Powys, (d. 900). Medieval kingdoms of Wales. ... 
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Upon the death of his father, Rhodri the Great in 878, Merfyn inherited the Kingdom of Powys. Merfyn's 2 brothers Anarawd ap Rhodri, and Cadell ap Rhodri received the Kingdoms of Gwynedd and Seisyllwg. Rhodri the Great a. ... Medi
1 CONC eval kingdoms of Wales. ... Anarawd ap Rhodri (died 916) was a King of Gwynedd. ... Gwynedd is an administrative county in Wales, named after the old Kingdom of Gwynedd. ... Seisyllwg was a kingdom of medieval Wales. ... 
1 CONT
