1 CONC he code of laws he composed is his lasting claimto fame. Three parts of his code are still found in English CommonLaw.  He was such a wise and just man that he was called "the head andglory of all the Britons." There is a place to
1 CONC day in Wales calledCrickhowell, which is considered to be either his home and/or pob.
