0 @N6000000003051115718@ NOTE [Weis 203] Arthur Jones, "The History of Gruffydd ap Cynan (Manchester, 1910), a translation and analysis of a twelfth century biography of Griffith, is the source for this [his] pedigree, with details verified and amplified from 
