1 CONT
1 CONT  The only legitimate son of England's King, Henry I, drowns off Harfleur in the White Ship disaster of 1120.
1 CONT
1 CONT  Having just returned from the First Crusade, Robert Curthose invades England in 1101, attempting to take the throne from his brother, Henry I.
