1 CONT Ref: Fourth and Youngest Son of William , riegned for 35 years.
1 CONT King Henry died while on a visit to Normandy and in his will named his favorite daughter, Matilda , as heir to all of his dominions.
1 CONT No sooner had Henry breathed his last than Stephen (Son of Adela,daughterof King William) hastened to England and with the influence of some Barons induced William, Archbishop of Canterbury, to crown
1 CONT  Stephen Kingof England.
