1 CONT William de Poitiers, Comte de Poitiers b. 17 Aug 1153, d. c Apr 1156
1 CONT Henry of England, Duc de Normandie+ b. 28 Feb 1155, d. 11 Jun 1183
1 CONT Matilda of England+ b. Jun 1156, d. 28 Jun 1189
1 CONT Richard I 'Coeur de Lion', King of England+ b. 8 Sep 1157, d. 6 Apr 1199
1 CONT Geoffrey II Plantagenet, Earl of Richmond+ b. 23 Sep 1158, d. 19 Aug 1186
1 CONT Eleanor Plantagenet+ b. 13 Oct 1162, d. 31 Oct 1214
